<Paintings>
  <Text 100 530 11 #000000 0 "J310 cascode VGA: Q2a=lower common-source, Q2b=upper common-gate. AGC: V_DAC 0-4V via R_VB(10k)/R2(30k) divider + V_ZEN(-5.6V ref) maps to V_AGC -1.4V(cutoff) to +1.6V(max). TANK=L1(1.9uH)||C1a(47pF)+C1b(20pF) ~14 MHz.">
